### login as local
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user": "local"
}

### login with blank user falls back to local
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user": ""
}

### login with empty JSON falls back to local
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{}
